    "title": "Merrill dedicates honorary street signs in memory of local historical figures - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Opinion ,\n9 hours ago In 2025, the City of Merrill Historic Preservation Committee continued its efforts to recognize individuals whose lives and service left a lasting impact on the Merrill community. These honors are bestowed through the dedication of honorary street signs at selected intersections in memory of individuals whose contributions helped shape Merrill’s history. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
